@startuml
title 상품 카테고리 구조 시퀀스 다이어그램

actor User
boundary Browser
control ProductController
entity CategoryService
entity ProductService
database DB

User -> Browser : 카테고리 선택 (강아지용품 > 사료)
Browser -> ProductController : GET /products/category/강아지용품/사료
ProductController -> CategoryService : getCategoryId("강아지용품", "사료")
CategoryService -> DB : SELECT category_id FROM categories\nWHERE name = '사료'\nAND parent_category_id = (\n  SELECT category_id FROM categories\n  WHERE name = '강아지용품'\n)
DB --> CategoryService : 카테고리 ID
CategoryService --> ProductController : 카테고리 ID
ProductController -> ProductService : getProductsByCategory(categoryId)
ProductService -> DB : SELECT p.*, c.name as category_name\nFROM products p\nJOIN categories c ON p.category_id = c.category_id\nWHERE p.category_id = ? AND p.is_active = 1
DB --> ProductService : 카테고리별 상품 목록
ProductService -> ProductService : calculateProductCounts()
ProductService -> DB : SELECT COUNT(*) FROM products\nWHERE category_id = ? AND stock > 0
DB --> ProductService : 재고 있는 상품 수
ProductService --> ProductController : 카테고리별 상품 목록 + 상품 수
ProductController --> Browser : 카테고리별 상품 결과

@enduml